			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Convert FileExplorerViewProvider to PascalCase Struct pattern\n\nDecompose the monolithic FileExplorerViewProvider implementation into the project-standard `Struct` variant pattern. Rename the primary type to `FileExplorerViewProvider::Struct`, update all method signatures, and rename local variables (e.g., `Uri` → `URI`, `Name` → `Name`) to strict PascalCase.\n\nRemove the verbose legacy documentation block in favor of concise module-level comments. Update `Source/FileSystem/mod.rs` to reflect the new structural layout. This aligns the native file explorer provider with recent refactorings in workspace and cache modules, ensuring consistent naming across the Mountain backend without altering file system reading logic or tree item DTO construction.",
			"SHA": "7c96f0f01beb9b982179c1808cfb4e79dd51827f"
